[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3624992191","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113737#issuecomment-3624992191","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113737","id":3624992191,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YEP2_","user":{"login":"Hamster5295","id":37259613,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjU5NjEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37259613?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamster5295","html_url":"https://github.com/Hamster5295","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamster5295/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamster5295/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamster5295/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamster5295/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamster5295/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamster5295/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamster5295/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamster5295/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamster5295/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-08T05:25:48Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T05:25:48Z","body":"<img width=\"2746\" height=\"841\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5808652c-4e8f-4b73-8cbe-f8b7188badb4\" />\nThe memory leak can be monitored through the built-in profiler as well.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3624992191/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3628969588","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113737#issuecomment-3628969588","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113737","id":3628969588,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YTa50","user":{"login":"kevinlam508","id":14243263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjQzMjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14243263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508","html_url":"https://github.com/kevinlam508","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-08T20:56:12Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T20:57:20Z","body":"Looks like a more general problem with short lived Godot collections used on the C# side.\nThe array isn't getting freed on the native side since the C# side doesn't do so until the collection is GC-ed and the C# side probably doesn't think it needs to GC since the managed memory use is low per collection instance.\n\nI was able to see more stable memory use by manually using dispose on the untyped collection:\n\n``` C#\nArray<Vector2I> list = GetUsedCells();\n// Do work\n((Array) list).Dispose();\n```\n\nOr if the array is only needed in the same scope:\n``` C#\nArray<Vector2I> list = GetUsedCells();\nusing var _ = (Array)list;\n// Do work\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3628969588/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3629266548","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113737#issuecomment-3629266548","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113737","id":3629266548,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YUjZ0","user":{"login":"markdibarry","id":21325943,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzI1OTQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21325943?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry","html_url":"https://github.com/markdibarry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-08T22:27:12Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T22:31:05Z","body":"This is more a misunderstanding of how the GC works in C#.\n\nIf you allocate a new array every frame like you're doing in your example project, a new one will be added on the heap until the GC finds it necessary to collect. When it collects is based on the GC and the amount of RAM you have available.\n\nIf you change your script to this:\n```cs\nusing System;\nusing Godot;\n\npublic partial class Leak : TileMapLayer\n{\n    public override void _PhysicsProcess(double delta)\n    {\n        base._PhysicsProcess(delta);\n        GC.Collect();\n        GC.WaitForPendingFinalizers();\n        GetUsedCells();\n    }\n}\n```\n\nYou'll notice your static memory will stay consistent. All arrays are collected, so there is no leak. I wouldn't recommend forcing the GC to collect, but I also wouldn't recommend allocating a new array every frame either.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3629266548/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3629669322","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113737#issuecomment-3629669322","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113737","id":3629669322,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YWFvK","user":{"login":"Hamster5295","id":37259613,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjU5NjEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37259613?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamster5295","html_url":"https://github.com/Hamster5295","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamster5295/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamster5295/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamster5295/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamster5295/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamster5295/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamster5295/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamster5295/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamster5295/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamster5295/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-09T00:40:07Z","updated_at":"2025-12-09T00:49:58Z","body":"Thank you very much for your help!  \n\n> The array isn't getting freed on the native side since the C# side doesn't do so until the collection is GC-ed and the C# side probably doesn't think it needs to GC since the managed memory use is low per collection instance.\n\nI believe this is exactly the main cause of my problem.  \n\nMaybe it can be documented somewhere? It might take up most of the memory if the collection is large enough.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3629669322/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5804550185","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113737#issuecomment-5804550185","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113737","id":5804550185,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWfpoKQ","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-23T23:18:46Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T23:18:46Z","body":"Closing as per the last comments.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5804550185/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]